<title>USA: United Healthcare gets AARP contract.</title>
<headline>United Healthcare gets AARP contract.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Healthcare Corp said it received a contract to deliver Medicare supplement insurance and develop new products for the American Association of Retired Persons beginning in January 1998.</p>
<p>Terms of the 10-year contract were not disclosed.</p>
<p>United Healthcare is the largest U.S. health maintenance organization holding company.  The AARP is a major organization and lobby for Americans over 50 years of age.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
